msgstr "do"

#: ui/main.qml:314
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Used as a noun, and precedes a combobox full of options"
msgid "Sub-pixel rendering:"
msgstr "Renderiranje podpikselima:"

#: ui/main.qml:352
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip Sub-pixel rendering"
msgid ""
"<para>On TFT or LCD screens every single pixel is actually composed of three "
"or four smaller monochrome lights. These <emphasis>sub-pixels</emphasis> can "
"be changed independently to further improve the quality of displayed fonts.</"
"para> <para>The rendering quality is only improved if the selection matches "
"the manner in which the sub-pixels of your display are aligned. Most "
"displays have a linear ordering of <emphasis>RGB</emphasis> sub-pixels, some "
"have <emphasis>BGR</emphasis> and some exotic orderings are not supported by "
"this feature.</para>This does not work with CRT monitors."
msgstr ""
"<para>Na TFT ili LCD zaslonima svaki pojedinačni piksel zapravo se sastoji "
"od tri ili četiri manja monokromatska svjetla. Ti <emphasis>podpikseli</"
"emphasis> mogu se mijenjati neovisno kako bi se dodatno poboljšala kvaliteta "
"prikazanih fontova.</para> <para>Kvaliteta renderiranja poboljšava se samo "
"ako odabir odgovara načinu na koji su podpikseli vašeg zaslona poravnati. "
"Većina zaslona ima linearan raspored <emphasis>RGB</emphasis> podpiksela, "
"neki imaju <emphasis>BGR</emphasis>, a neki egzotični rasporedi nisu "
"podržani ovom značajkom.</para>Ovo ne funkcionira s CRT monitorima."

#: ui/main.qml:357
#, kde-format
msgctxt "Used as a noun, and precedes a combobox full of options"
msgid "Hinting:"
msgstr "Hinting:"

#: ui/main.qml:394
#, kde-kuit-format
msgctxt "@info:tooltip Hinting"
msgid ""
"Hinting is a technique in which hints embedded in a font are used to enhance "
"the rendering quality especially at small sizes. Stronger hinting generally "
"leads to sharper edges but the small letters will less closely resemble "
"their shape at big sizes."
msgstr ""
"Hinting je tehnika u kojoj se ugrađeni savjeti fonta koriste za poboljšanje "
"kvalitete renderiranja, posebno pri malim veličinama. Jači hinting općenito "
"daje oštrije rubove, ali će mala slova manje nalikovati svojem obliku pri "
"velikim veličinama."
